<sect1 id="pg-graph-search">
 <title>pg_graph_search</title>
 <para>
  <application>pg_graph_search</application> provides pure-SQL property graph
  traversal for an existing OpenTenBase edge table.  The extension installs a
  metadata schema and generates concrete, schema-qualified functions for an
  application graph instance.
 </para>
 <sect2><title>Functions</title>
  <para><function>graph_search.advise(jsonb)</function> performs non-mutating
  index and configuration checks. <function>plan(jsonb)</function> returns the
  DDL before it is executed. <function>install(jsonb)</function> executes the
  plan and records the instance; <function>uninstall(text,text)</function>
  removes it.</para>
 </sect2>
 <sect2><title>Limits</title>
  <para>This release establishes the replicated-edge-table baseline.  For a
  HASH-distributed edge table, validate result equivalence and performance
  before production use.  The generated functions enforce the installation
  time <literal>max_depth_cap</literal>.</para>
 </sect2>
</sect1>
